# Skill Wallet - Comprehensive Measure of Well-being

A web app to track personal well-being across 5 dimensions.

## Features
- Add skills with level and evidence
- Auto-calculated overall well-being score
- Save data locally
- Action plan section

## How to Run
1. Download all files
2. Open `index.html` in browser
3. Or deploy on GitHub Pages

Created for Skill Wallet Project 2026
